step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to Captain Tock just south of the entrance to Falador farm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Captain Tock on the single dock just west of Rimmington.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Upon arrival to Corsair, make sure to speak with <col=800000>Ithoi the Navigator</col> first or else the other npc chats will not work correctly. Find Ithoi by travelling west along the beach. Climb the stairs of the southernmost building on the beach.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Speak to Captain Tock just south of the entrance to Falador farm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Captain Tock on the single dock just west of Rimmington.</str>
line	
line	<str>Upon arrival to Corsair, make sure to speak with Ithoi the Navigator first or else the other npc chats will not work correctly. Find Ithoi by travelling west along the beach. Climb the stairs of the southernmost building on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Arsen the Thief</col> (upstairs in the first house west off the docks).</col>
