line	<str>Upon arrival to Corsair, make sure to speak with Ithoi the Navigator first or else the other npc chats will not work correctly. Find Ithoi by travelling west along the beach. Climb the stairs of the southernmost building on the beach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Arsen the Thief (upstairs in the first house west off the docks).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Cabin Boy Colin (in the same room as Arsen, just east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Gnocci the Cook (upstairs in the building just north-west).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Captain Tock back on the boat (cross south gangplank) to receive the ogre artefact.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Chief Tess in the Corsair Cove Dungeon (dungeon entrance is just west, in the middle of four small pillars) .</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a Spade to dig the lump of sand next to the tree where Gnocci the Cook fished in the cutscene. (see image)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the telescope on the deck of Ithoi the Navigator's hut.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Gnocci the Cook and speak to him.</str>
